<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" intro="How this website handles general inquiries and protects sensitive information."><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>When you contact New Beginnings through this website, we may receive your name, email address, phone number, reason for contacting us, and message.</p><h2>Do not send sensitive information</h2><p>The public contact form is not intended for medical records, diagnoses, medication information, treatment histories, criminal-history details, Social Security numbers, financial-account information, or other sensitive personal information.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information submitted through the website is used to respond to inquiries, discuss housing or referral needs, and communicate about donations or partnerships. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2>Residence privacy</h2><p>New Beginnings does not publish individual recovery-residence addresses on this website. Exact locations may be shared privately when appropriate during intake.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy may be directed to 412-628-0403.</p></LegalLayout>
